1
00:00:00,740 --> 00:00:02,110
See.

2
00:00:02,110 --> 00:00:08,110
Millie and Toby are talking about what makes their school lives special.

3
00:00:08,110 --> 00:00:12,420
Work in pairs and talk about your school life.

4
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:16,530
Use the conversation below as a model.

5
00:00:16,530 --> 00:00:21,400
What makes your school life special, Toby?

6
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:26,030
For me, I'd say it's the school clubs.

7
00:00:26,030 --> 00:00:32,660
There are lots to choose from, so everybody can find a great club.

8
00:00:32,660 --> 00:00:35,620
I'm a member of the tennis club.

9
00:00:35,620 --> 00:00:39,020
I love practicing with my partner.

10
00:00:39,020 --> 00:00:41,580
What about you, Millie?

11
00:00:41,580 --> 00:00:44,580
I think it's my school friends.

12
00:00:44,580 --> 00:00:47,580
I like to spend time with them.

13
00:00:47,580 --> 00:00:51,110
We have many happy moments together.

14
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,660
My days are never boring with so many friends.

15
00:00:55,660 --> 00:00:58,020
That's really nice!
